/-
    Billboard, drawn at the width it is meant to be seen at.

    One demo at a time. The examples are variants of the same section rather than a stack of them, so
    what is on screen is always the whole module at full width, and the bar switches between them.

    The sample content is built here rather than read from a content channel. The adapter in
    ModularSystem/Modules reads Module V2 attributes, so demoing through it would mean a channel and
    items in every theme this guide is dropped into. The template underneath takes plain dictionaries,
    which is what a style guide is actually documenting. The cost is that this proves the template
    renders, not that the adapter maps its attributes correctly.

    The table lists only what an admin can actually set and only what is worth knowing at a glance.
    The template accepts more than the module exposes, so building the table from the template's own
    documentation would list settings that are unreachable in Rock. The list to check against is the
    two adapters together:

        ModularSystem/Modules/Billboard.lava - Height, VerticalAlignment, ShadowHeight,
                                               ShowSocialLinks, BackgroundVideo
        ModularSystem/Modules/Base.lava      - BackgroundColor, ForegroundColor, BackgroundImage,
                                               Padding, and the intro matrix

    Parameters:
        variant - Which example to draw. Already validated against the manifest by Base.lava, so an
                  unknown value never reaches here. (Required, Text)
-/

//- MARK: Sample Content
{% assign sampleButton = ''
    | AddToDictionary:'Key','#'
    | AddToDictionary:'Value','Make a Commitment'
%}
{% assign sampleButtons = '' | AddToArray:sampleButton %}

{% assign intro = ''
    | AddToDictionary:'kicker','Are You Ready?'
    | AddToDictionary:'heading','Make Your Commitment'
    | AddToDictionary:'description','A billboard carries one idea and one action. Anything longer belongs in the section under it.'
    | AddToDictionary:'buttons',sampleButtons
%}

{% assign content = '' | AddToDictionary:'intro',intro %}

//- MARK: Settings
/- Built from scratch per variant rather than derived from the one above it. AddToDictionary returns
   the dictionary it was handed, so deriving would leave every variant pointing at one object and
   make them depend on the order they happen to be written in. -/
{% assign colors = ''
    | AddToDictionary:'background','#000000'
    | AddToDictionary:'foreground','#f0efe4'
%}

{% assign sampleImage = '/Themes/GreaterThingsV1/Assets/Images/Fallbacks/Fallback-16-9.jpg' %}

/- Three examples. Each changes several settings at once rather than isolating one, which is the
   trade for keeping the list to three: the table underneath is what says which values produced
   what is on screen.

   Content alignment stays centered throughout, so start, end and split are not shown here.

     height             small      medium     full
     verticalalignment  top        bottom     center
     shadowheight       50         100        50
     verticalpadding    medium     large      large
     headingsize        h1         display-1  display-1
     contentalignment   center     center     center -/
{% case variant %}
    {% when 'medium' %}
        {% assign introSettings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'headingsize','display-1'
            | AddToDictionary:'contentalignment','center'
        %}
        {% assign settings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'colors',colors
            | AddToDictionary:'backgroundimage',sampleImage
            | AddToDictionary:'height','medium'
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalalignment','center'
            | AddToDictionary:'shadowheight',100
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalpadding','small'
            | AddToDictionary:'intro',introSettings
        %}

    {% when 'full' %}
        {% assign introSettings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'headingsize','display-1'
            | AddToDictionary:'contentalignment','center'
        %}
        {% assign settings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'colors',colors
            | AddToDictionary:'backgroundimage',sampleImage
            | AddToDictionary:'height','full'
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalalignment','center'
            | AddToDictionary:'shadowheight',50
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalpadding','small'
            | AddToDictionary:'intro',introSettings
        %}

    {% when 'video' %}
        {% assign sampleVideoArray = sampleVideoIds | Split:',' %}
        {% assign sampleVideoId = sampleVideoArray | First %}
        {% assign introSettings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'headingsize','display-1'
            | AddToDictionary:'contentalignment','center'
        %}
        {% assign settings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'colors',colors
            | AddToDictionary:'backgroundimage',sampleImage
            | AddToDictionary:'backgroundvideo',sampleVideoId
            | AddToDictionary:'height','full'
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalalignment','center'
            | AddToDictionary:'shadowheight',100
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalpadding','small'
            | AddToDictionary:'intro',introSettings
        %}

    {% when 'dev-heading-only' %}
        {% assign introHeadingOnly = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'heading','Make Your Commitment'
        %}
        {% assign content = '' | AddToDictionary:'intro',introHeadingOnly %}
        {% assign introSettings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'headingsize','display-1'
            | AddToDictionary:'contentalignment','center'
        %}
        {% assign settings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'colors',colors
            | AddToDictionary:'backgroundimage',sampleImage
            | AddToDictionary:'height','medium'
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalalignment','center'
            | AddToDictionary:'shadowheight',100
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalpadding','small'
            | AddToDictionary:'intro',introSettings
        %}

    {% when 'dev-no-image' %}
        {% assign introSettings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'headingsize','display-1'
            | AddToDictionary:'contentalignment','center'
        %}
        {% assign settings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'colors',colors
            | AddToDictionary:'height','medium'
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalalignment','center'
            | AddToDictionary:'shadowheight',0
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalpadding','small'
            | AddToDictionary:'intro',introSettings
        %}

    {% when 'dev-long-content' %}
        {% assign longDescription = 'We believe that following Jesus is the most important decision you will ever make, and we want to walk alongside you every step of the way — from your very first visit all the way through baptism, small groups, serving, and beyond. This is not a destination. It is a journey, and it is better together.' %}
        {% assign introLong = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'kicker','Are You Ready?'
            | AddToDictionary:'heading','Make Your Commitment'
            | AddToDictionary:'description',longDescription
            | AddToDictionary:'buttons',sampleButtons
        %}
        {% assign content = '' | AddToDictionary:'intro',introLong %}
        {% assign introSettings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'headingsize','display-1'
            | AddToDictionary:'contentalignment','center'
        %}
        {% assign settings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'colors',colors
            | AddToDictionary:'backgroundimage',sampleImage
            | AddToDictionary:'height','medium'
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalalignment','center'
            | AddToDictionary:'shadowheight',100
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalpadding','small'
            | AddToDictionary:'intro',introSettings
        %}

    {% when 'dev-invalid-video' %}
        {% assign introSettings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'headingsize','display-1'
            | AddToDictionary:'contentalignment','center'
        %}
        {% assign settings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'colors',colors
            | AddToDictionary:'backgroundimage',sampleImage
            | AddToDictionary:'backgroundvideo',99999
            | AddToDictionary:'height','full'
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalalignment','center'
            | AddToDictionary:'shadowheight',100
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalpadding','small'
            | AddToDictionary:'intro',introSettings
        %}

    {% else %}
        {% assign introSettings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'headingsize','h1'
            | AddToDictionary:'contentalignment','center'
        %}
        {% assign settings = ''
            | AddToDictionary:'colors',colors
            | AddToDictionary:'backgroundimage',sampleImage
            | AddToDictionary:'height','small'
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalalignment','center'
            | AddToDictionary:'shadowheight',50
            | AddToDictionary:'verticalpadding','small'
            | AddToDictionary:'intro',introSettings
        %}
{% endcase %}

//- MARK: Markup
<div class="container styleguide-brief">
    {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/StyleGuide/Partials/PageHeader.lava', title:'Billboard', description:'A full width hero. Content over a background image, optionally with a overlay beneath it for legibility.' %}
</div>

//- Every value is read back out of the dictionary the demo above was handed, so the table cannot
//- drift from what produced the render. Only the row list is written by hand.
{% capture rows %}
    <tr>
        <th scope="row">Height</th>
        <td>{{ settings.height }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <th scope="row">Overlay height</th>
        <td>{{ settings.shadowheight }}%{% if settings.shadowheight == 100 %} &middot; flat overlay{% elsif settings.shadowheight == 0 %} &middot; off{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <th scope="row">Heading size</th>
        <td>{{ settings.intro.headingsize }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% if settings.backgroundvideo != blank %}
    <tr>
        <th scope="row">Video</th>
        <td>Media #{{ settings.backgroundvideo }} &middot; muted loop, image fallback</td>
    </tr>
    {% endif %}
{% endcapture %}
{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/StyleGuide/Partials/SettingsTable.lava', rows:rows %}

{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Custom/Templates/Billboard.lava', content:content, settings:settings %}
